{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/286636-sidereal-magical-blindfolds-interactions","id":286636,"title":"Sidereal Magical Blindfolds Interactions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-19T08:41:27-07:00","id":286636,"title":"Sidereal Magical Blindfolds Interactions","content":"Harmonic Completion, the Sidereal Performance capstone, turns a prayer strip into a starmetal-and-jade blindfold. This blindfold gives you sundry bonuses, but is also, well, a blindfold. <br /> <br /> Perfection of the Visionary Warrior, the Sidereal Melee capstone, turns a prayer strip into a blindfold. This blindfold does not actually blind you, but rather lets you see the patterns of fate and grants sundry bonuses. <br /> <br /> How do these Charms interact? Is a character using both magical blindfolds blind as per Harmonic Completion, or supersighted as per PotVW? How does this all interact with the Revelation Blindfold, an Artifact from <i>Glories: Maidens</i> that grants you Sorcerer's Sight for as long as you wear it, but which makes you blind if you <i>remove </i>it?<br /> <br /> How stupid does a character layering three different magical blindfolds on top of each other have to look? <br /> <br /> These are the questions that I am asking you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T09:02:25-07:00","id":286666,"title":"","content":"I'd honestly say that they're all mutually exclusive, but...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How stupid does a character layering three different magical blindfolds on top of each other have to look? </div> </div> </div>I'm pretty sure I've seen decent-looking character designs with multilayered blindfolds. It's all in <i>how</i> you layer them; wearing each slightly askew for artful asymmetry is probably the way to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T09:24:11-07:00","id":286682,"title":"","content":"All the blindfolds. Ultimate Blind Sifu.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":2093,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","user":"Crumplepunch","date":". 10-19-2014, 12:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T09:29:52-07:00","id":286684,"title":"","content":"The second Blindfold is worn upon the head as earmuffs and the third and final one placed over the mouth. If you're going to look stupid you may as well go all out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T09:49:13-07:00","id":286691,"title":"","content":"Just completely cover the head, then you can see and do ALL THE THINGS!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/393-godjaw","name":"Godjaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar393_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"665"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T09:58:09-07:00","id":286712,"title":"","content":"See no Evil, Hear no Evil, Speak no Evil.<br /> <br /> Why not?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Aretii: &quot;As one of the players described it, 'After initiation, it was actually a relief seeing who had eyepatches or bandaged hands - you know what <i>they</i> sacrificed, instead of wondering what bits people cut out of their own souls to gain power.'&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/578-lord-sia","name":"Lord Sia","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T10:40:41-07:00","id":286751,"title":"","content":"So the Revelation Blindfold can't be removed without removing bonuses, that says nothing about adding effects on top of it. PVW is kind of a blindfold but also basically gives you a form of Essence or Fate-sight or whatever. I see no reason why these things shouldn't stack and HC doesn't say anything about not gaining the powers it gives you if you have another way to see.<br /> <br /> No rule says they don't stack, ergo they stack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T05:59:51-07:00","id":287512,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lord Sia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/286636-sidereal-magical-blindfolds-interactions?p=286712#post286712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">See no Evil, Hear no Evil, Speak no Evil.<br /> <br /> Why not?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because you can still Smell Evil. Gotta add some noseplugs - preferably ones that make you immune to suffocation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1551-barefoot-monkey","name":"Barefoot Monkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1551_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T06:18:08-07:00","id":287523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Barefoot Monkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/286636-sidereal-magical-blindfolds-interactions?p=287512#post287512\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because you can still Smell Evil. Gotta add some noseplugs - preferably ones that make you immune to suffocation.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Mask of Pure Breath, and we're done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T21:09:06-07:00","id":288224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/286636-sidereal-magical-blindfolds-interactions?p=286666#post286666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd honestly say that they're all mutually exclusive, but...<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure I've seen decent-looking character designs with multilayered blindfolds. It's all in <i>how</i> you layer them; wearing each slightly askew for artful asymmetry is probably the way to go.</div> </div> </div> </div>I liked this image, but what threw me off about it was the unequally magical nature of the blindfold and their different durations. One is permanent, one lasts a scene, one lasts five days, one is a band of jade and starmetal and the other is just a plain old blindfold...<br /> <br /> But now I have it. Multilayered blindfolds, yes; but multilayered while still prayer stips, not &quot;activated.&quot; And not three - a dozen. assymetrically (I want to say &quot;in an artistically disorderly fashion&quot;) layered, maybe clasped to the side because they aren't long enough to wrap around the head as a &quot;real&quot; blindfold. Crisscrossing slightly so that rather than being a bulky band, they look more like a <i>mask</i>, wider at the edges/temples than at the center/eyes. Each scribbled with old realm glyphs.<br /> <br /> When the Sidereal summons one of her capstone Charm, a prayer strip flares with Essence and reveals its power. When it's a normal prayer strip, it burns, or detaches from the mask, does its thing. When it's Melee or Performance, it is empowered, but it really looks like it's a single entity, a mask of layered magical strips, that provides this power, rather than powerful distinct Charms that do not aesthetically mesh together. <br /> <br /> That way, you can even have your own bizarro take on classic &quot;blindfold of power scenes,&quot; or even going straight-up Medusa, like the character peeling off an irrelevant strip to reveal the scripture of Conclusive Wisdom, locking eyes with his opponents and delivering a deadly stare.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T21:09:16-07:00","id":288225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/286636-sidereal-magical-blindfolds-interactions?p=286666#post286666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd honestly say that they're all mutually exclusive, but...<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm pretty sure I've seen decent-looking character designs with multilayered blindfolds. It's all in <i>how</i> you layer them; wearing each slightly askew for artful asymmetry is probably the way to go.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd take a cue from DFO's Asura class spec.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRmfrEQPHJLK-qbWzmY03A48S9aEQ8W9IlcBubyAEido6CPtErswg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Just add an extra one in between the other two.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/2480852/chapters/5503997\" target=\"_blank\">Glorious Echeladder Ascension Technique</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/287292-glorious-echeladder-ascension-technique-a-homestuck-exalted-crossover\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Topic</a><br /> <br /> &quot;Look, sometimes you just are in the mood to play the divinely empowered champion of the God of Farts. Mechanically optimized play is not the only way to enjoy playing your character.&quot; -Wise Old Guru","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1048-ryumaru","name":"Ryumaru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1048_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}